    "type": "game",
    "name": "KUUKIYOMI: Consider It World - Thailand Ver.",
    "steam_appid": 3606690,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introducing the New Title: \u201cKUUKIYOMI: Consider It World\u201d!</strong><br><strong>This time, the stage is Thailand! </strong> <br><strong>Test your ability to read the room in familiar, everyday Thai scenarios, packed with cultural quirks and \u201cThat\u2019s so true!\u201d moments.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new installment in the hit \u201cConsider It\u201d series.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the uniquely Thai world of social subtleties and unspoken rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 entirely original episodes, crafted by a team of Thai creators.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by Urnique Studio, the creators of the award-winning \u201cTimelie.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>How To Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/extras/96aaa15ba71804eafda92668bf44a079.avif?t=1751848563\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple: \u201c<br>Move the red object on the screen \u2014 usually \u201cyou\u201d (the main character) \u2014 to navigate each situation.<br>Depending on the context, you might control something else entirely.<br>Play through all 100 episodes to get your final evaluation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/extras/1ed14aba228ec921978c0eb0b4d0bcf3.avif?t=1751848563\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, \u201cYou\u201d, travels from Japan to Thailand.<br>As you spend time with your new Thai friend, they slowly begin to understand what it means to \u201cread the air.\u201d<br>What kind of decisions will they make in each unique Thai situation?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Evaluation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like in previous titles, your ability to read the room will be analyzed at the end.<br>Play through all 100 scenarios to receive a final evaluation \u2014 with a Thai twist! <br>(Your result will change depending on how you play each time.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbConsider It Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through all 100 situations in one go</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive your final evaluation at the end</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbChapter Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing the main game, revisit and play each episode individually</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* No evaluation is given in this mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbSecrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains hidden titles (achievements)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you discover them depends entirely on your choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbThe Past You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit your past results and track your evolution!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introducing the New Title: \u201cKUUKIYOMI: Consider It World\u201d!</strong><br><strong>This time, the stage is Thailand! </strong> <br><strong>Test your ability to read the room in familiar, everyday Thai scenarios, packed with cultural quirks and \u201cThat\u2019s so true!\u201d moments.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new installment in the hit \u201cConsider It\u201d series.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the uniquely Thai world of social subtleties and unspoken rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 entirely original episodes, crafted by a team of Thai creators.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by Urnique Studio, the creators of the award-winning \u201cTimelie.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>How To Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/extras/96aaa15ba71804eafda92668bf44a079.avif?t=1751848563\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple: \u201c<br>Move the red object on the screen \u2014 usually \u201cyou\u201d (the main character) \u2014 to navigate each situation.<br>Depending on the context, you might control something else entirely.<br>Play through all 100 episodes to get your final evaluation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606690/extras/1ed14aba228ec921978c0eb0b4d0bcf3.avif?t=1751848563\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, \u201cYou\u201d, travels from Japan to Thailand.<br>As you spend time with your new Thai friend, they slowly begin to understand what it means to \u201cread the air.\u201d<br>What kind of decisions will they make in each unique Thai situation?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Evaluation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like in previous titles, your ability to read the room will be analyzed at the end.<br>Play through all 100 scenarios to receive a final evaluation \u2014 with a Thai twist! <br>(Your result will change depending on how you play each time.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbConsider It Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through all 100 situations in one go</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive your final evaluation at the end</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbChapter Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing the main game, revisit and play each episode individually</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* No evaluation is given in this mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbSecrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains hidden titles (achievements)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you discover them depends entirely on your choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbThe Past You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit your past results and track your evolution!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
